cartridge "RAILYARD/AMY BIENVENU/2026"

' RAILYARD - an original railway puzzle for the ColecoVision.
'
' Trains come out of the tunnels, one after another, each painted the
' colour of the station it must reach. They follow the track by
' themselves; you set the points (the switches, drawn in white: the way
' they are set is joined, the other way shows only a stub). A train that
' runs through points from a branch side goes on along the stem. A train
' at the wrong station, back in a tunnel, or in a crash is a wreck: three
' wrecks and the yard closes. Eight yards.
'
' House rules: joystick and button only; text in columns 2-29, rows 1-22;
' tiles from code 128 (art.py); an original tune played once (tune.py);
' the frame loop keeps the NMI off outside the wait (Frame1).
'
' Screen: row 1 the counters, rows 2-20 the yard (28 x 19 cells, one tile
' each, in the name table itself: rail.asm), row 22 the next train.
' Sprites are 8 x 8: sprite 0 the pointer, 1-6 the trains.

